---
import MainGridLayout from "@/layouts/MainGridLayout.astro";

interface Props {
	lang?: string;
}

const { lang = Astro.url.pathname.startsWith("/en") ? "en" : "zh_CN" } =
	Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === "en";

const title = isEn
	? "Verdant Star · WD J1330+6435 Lab"
	: "幽绿星 · VERDANT STAR";
const description = isEn
	? "Verdant Star: Exploring WD J1330+6435, the first known genuinely green star, roughly 280 light-years away in Draco. Extreme helium-sodium collisional broadening subtracts orange and red to unveil a ghostly chartreuse glow (RAS Techniques and Instruments 2026)."
	: "幽绿星 · VERDANT STAR：探索天文学确认的首颗真正绿色恒星——白矮星 WD J1330+6435。《皇家天文学会仪器与技术》2026年10月发表成果：超高密度富氦大气中钠原子碰撞致宽，吸收黄橙红光谱，在4000°C恒星遗骸上刻蚀出一抹不可思议的黄绿幽光。";
---

<MainGridLayout title={title} description={description} lang={lang}>
	<div class="flex w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden relative min-h-32 mb-8">
		<div class="z-10 px-4 sm:px-8 py-8 relative w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden bg-[#070b14] text-slate-100 border border-slate-800/80 shadow-2xl selection:bg-lime-500/30 selection:text-lime-200">
			<!-- Ambient Chartreuse & Deep Space Glow -->
			<div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(#84cc16_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:28px_28px] overflow-hidden"></div>
			<div class="absolute -top-32 -left-32 w-96 h-96 bg-lime-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute top-1/4 -right-32 w-96 h-96 bg-rose-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute bottom-10 left-1/3 w-96 h-96 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

			<!-- HERO HEADER SECTION -->
			<header class="relative z-10 mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-slate-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-lime-500/10 border border-lime-500/30 text-lime-400 text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-wide">
							<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-lime-400 animate-pulse"></span>
							<span>RAS TECH & INST · 2026-10-16 · HOLLANDS ET AL.</span>
						</div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-300 text-xs font-mono">
							<span>✨</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">天体物理 · 恒星光谱重构实验</span>
							<span class="lang-en">ASTROPHYSICS · STELLAR COLOR RECONSTRUCTION</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- In-Page Language Switcher -->
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 hidden sm:block">
							<span class="lang-zh">天龙座方向 · 距地约 280 光年</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Constellation Draco · ~280 Light-Years</span>
						</div>
						<a
							id="inpage-lang-toggle"
							href={isEn ? "/projects/verdant-star/" : "/en/projects/verdant-star/"}
							class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-lime-500/40 text-lime-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-lime-950/60 font-mono text-xs transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95"
							title={isEn ? "Switch to Chinese" : "切换为英文"}
						>
							<svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
								<path d="m12.87 15.07-2.54-2.51.03-.03A17.52 17.52 0 0 0 14.07 6H17V4h-7V2H8v2H1v2h11.17C11.5 7.92 10.44 9.75 9 11.35 8.07 10.32 7.3 9.19 6.69 8h-2c.73 1.63 1.73 3.17 2.98 4.56l-5.09 5.02L4 19l5-5 3.11 3.11.76-2.04zM18.5 10h-2L12 22h2l1.12-3h4.75L21 22h2l-4.5-12zm-2.62 7 1.62-4.33L19.12 17h-3.24z"/>
							</svg>
							<span class="lang-zh font-bold">English</span>
							<span class="lang-en font-bold">中文</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-white mb-2 font-sans">
					<span class="lang-zh">幽绿星 · VERDANT STAR</span>
					<span class="lang-en">VERDANT STAR · WD J1330+6435</span>
				</h1>

				<p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-lime-400 mb-4 tracking-wide font-mono">
					<span class="lang-zh">宇宙中最不可思议的一抹幽光：天文学家首次证实真正呈现绿色的恒星。</span>
					<span class="lang-en">The most improbable glow in the cosmos: astronomers confirm the first genuinely green star.</span>
				</p>

				<div class="space-y-3 max-w-3xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
					<p>
						<span class="lang-zh">
							2026 年 10 月 15/16 日，英国华威大学（University of Warwick）马克·霍兰兹（Mark Hollands）与鲍里斯·根西克（Boris Gänsicke）等人在国际天文学术期刊《皇家天文学会仪器与技术》（<em>RAS Techniques and Instruments</em>）发表里程碑研究：在距地球约 <strong>280 光年</strong>的天龙座方向，确认了一颗表面温度约 <strong>4,000 °C</strong> 的奇特白矮星——<strong>WD J1330+6435</strong>。它是一颗低至中等质量恒星核燃料耗尽、抛离外壳后遗留下的超致密恒星遗骸，将约半个太阳的质量压缩在与地球体积相当的微小球体内。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							Reported in mid-October 2026 by lead author Mark Hollands and co-author Boris Gänsicke (University of Warwick) in <em>RAS Techniques and Instruments</em>, astronomers identified an unprecedented stellar relic roughly <strong>280 light-years</strong> away in Draco at approximately <strong>4,000 °C</strong>: white dwarf <strong>WD J1330+6435</strong>. It is a stellar corpse—the dense core of a star that exhausted its nuclear fuel and shed its outer layers, compacting roughly half the Sun's mass into an Earth-sized sphere.
						</span>
					</p>
					<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400">
						<span class="lang-zh">
							这颗死寂的白矮星吞噬了曾经环绕其运转的岩石行星碎片，使得高密度富氦外层大气富集了钙、锂、尤其是大量的钠。在极端稠密的氦气包层中，钠原子受到氦原子永不停歇的高频剧烈碰撞扰动（碰撞致宽 / 压力致宽），原本狭窄的橙色钠双线（~589 nm）被极度拓宽为吞噬了黄、橙乃至部分红光的浩瀚吸收带。当这些暖色波段被悉数扣除后，残存的光芒便显露出前所未见的<strong>查特酒绿幽光（chartreuse green glow）</strong>。据研究团队所知，已知所有存活或死亡的恒星中，此前从未有过任何一颗被可靠确认为绿色。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							The white dwarf accreted rocky debris from shredded former planetary bodies, enriching its helium-rich atmosphere with calcium, lithium, and especially sodium. In its ultra-dense helium envelope, sodium atoms undergo violent, incessant bombardment by helium atoms (collisional broadening). This stretches the usually narrow orange sodium D-line into colossal absorption bands engulfing yellow, orange, and some red light. With those wavelengths subtracted from its 4,000 °C continuum, what remains is an otherworldly <strong>chartreuse green glow</strong>. As far as researchers are aware, no other star, living or dead, has ever been credibly reported as green.
						</span>
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Attributed Researcher Quote Card (Hollands only) -->
				<div class="mt-6 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-lime-500/30 relative overflow-hidden">
					<div class="text-xs font-mono text-lime-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
						<span>💬</span>
						<span class="lang-zh">领衔作者论断 · MARK HOLLANDS (WARWICK)</span>
						<span class="lang-en">LEAD AUTHOR PERSPECTIVE · MARK HOLLANDS (WARWICK)</span>
					</div>
					<blockquote class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-200 italic font-serif leading-relaxed">
						<span class="lang-zh">
							马克·霍兰兹指出，高密大气中的钠吸收了光谱中的橙光部分，留下了幽灵般的黄绿幽光——“<strong class="text-lime-300">Imagine standing on a planet and looking up at a green star. It feels like something out of science fiction.</strong>”
							<span class="block text-xs font-sans text-slate-400 not-italic mt-1">（“想象一下站在一颗行星表面，抬头仰望一颗绿色的恒星。这感觉就像科幻小说里的景象。”）</span>
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							Mark Hollands said the sodium absorbs the orange part of the spectrum, leaving a ghostly green glow—"<strong class="text-lime-300">Imagine standing on a planet and looking up at a green star. It feels like something out of science fiction.</strong>"
						</span>
					</blockquote>
				</div>

				<!-- Scientific Honesty Note Card -->
				<div class="mt-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-amber-500/30 text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
					<div class="text-amber-400 font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5 flex items-center gap-2">
						<span>🔭</span>
						<span class="lang-zh">科学严谨性特别说明：这是重构模型，而非肉眼直视</span>
						<span class="lang-en">SCIENTIFIC HONESTY NOTE: RECONSTRUCTED MODEL, NOT EYE OBSERVATION</span>
					</div>
					<p>
						<span class="lang-zh">
							必须诚实指出：<strong>没有任何人的眼睛真正亲眼见过这抹绿光</strong>。白矮星极其暗弱，即便在地面顶级口径望远镜中也仅仅呈现为一个毫无视面积的光斑点，绝非肉眼可见的彩色圆盘。本页面与论文展示的色彩，是基于高分辨实测光谱、恒星辐射转移大气模型以及国际照明委员会（CIE）标准人类颜色视觉系统综合还原重构的——即<strong>“如果你近距离飞临它面前时肉眼所见的样子”</strong>。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							Crucial honesty note: <strong>nobody has seen this green with human eyes</strong>. White dwarfs are intensely faint, appearing as unresolved point sources even in giant telescopes, never as resolved colored discs. The color showcased here is reconstructed by marrying calibrated stellar spectra and radiative transfer atmospheric models with the CIE standard human color vision observer model: <strong>"what it would look like up close."</strong>
						</span>
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Key Discovery Facts Row -->
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mt-6">
					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-lime-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
							<span class="lang-zh">目标星体与星宿</span>
							<span class="lang-en">TARGET & CONSTELLATION</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-2xl font-mono font-black text-white mt-1">WD J1330+6435</div>
						<div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">天龙座 · 距地约 280 光年</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Constellation Draco · ~280 ly</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-amber-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
							<span class="lang-zh">有效表面温度</span>
							<span class="lang-en">SURFACE TEMPERATURE</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-2xl font-mono font-black text-amber-300 mt-1">~4,000 °C</div>
						<div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">~4,270 K · 原生橙红辐射连续谱</span>
							<span class="lang-en">~4,270 K · Baseline orange glow</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-teal-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
							<span class="lang-zh">恒星质量与体积</span>
							<span class="lang-en">STELLAR DENSITY</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-2xl font-mono font-black text-teal-300 mt-1">~0.5 M☉ / 地球大小</div>
						<div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">半个太阳压缩至地球体积</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Half solar mass in Earth volume</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-rose-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
							<span class="lang-zh">最红姐妹星发现</span>
							<span class="lang-en">REDDEST COMPANION</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-2xl font-mono font-black text-rose-300 mt-1">WD J1011+2845</div>
						<div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">小狮座 48 光年 · 碳对流深肉粉</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Leo Minor 48 ly · Salmon-pink</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</header>

			<!-- 1. CENTERPIECE: STAR PAINTER (SPECTRUM MIXER) -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-12 pb-10 border-b border-slate-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-6">
					<div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-lime-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">
							<span>🎨 核心交互实验室</span>
							<span>·</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">恒星调色盘</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Star Painter Spectrum Engine</span>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
							<span class="lang-zh">恒星调色盘：用光谱雕琢宇宙唯一的幽绿</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Star Painter: Sculpting the Green Glow via Absorption</span>
						</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="text-xs font-mono px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-lime-500/40 text-lime-300">
						<span class="lang-zh">⚠️ 物理学示意模型，非研究人员实测精确谱线</span>
						<span class="lang-en">⚠️ Illustrative model of physics, not exact spectra</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<p class="text-sm text-slate-300 mb-6 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
					<span class="lang-zh">
						基准始于一颗约 4,000 °C 的常规冷白矮星热辐射（原本呈温暖的橙红火光）。拨动下方吸收滑块或轻点预设，模拟不同行星碎屑与大气碰撞对 380–750 nm 可见光波段的“剪裁”：<strong>唯有精准剔除黄、橙与部分红光，深藏在光谱中央的黄绿基底才能在人眼模型中脱颖而出</strong>。
					</span>
					<span class="lang-en">
						Begin with the baseline 4,000 °C thermal radiation of a cooling white dwarf (an orange glow). Toggle absorption bands or choose presets below to simulate how planetary debris and collisional broadening subtract specific slices from the 380–750 nm spectrum: <strong>only by carving away yellow, orange, and red can chartreuse green emerge in human perception</strong>.
					</span>
				</p>

				<!-- PRESET BUTTONS ROW -->
				<div class="mb-6 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
					<div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-2.5 flex items-center gap-2">
						<span>⚡</span>
						<span class="lang-zh">科学特征预设（一键载入恒星光谱配置）:</span>
						<span class="lang-en">Scientific Presets (One-click Stellar Configurations):</span>
					</div>
					<div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-2" id="preset-buttons">
						<button
							type="button"
							data-preset="ordinary"
							class="preset-btn px-2.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono font-bold border transition text-left cursor-pointer active:scale-95 bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500"
						>
							<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-amber-400">
								<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#ffa652] inline-block"></span>
								<span class="lang-zh">普通 4,000°C 恒星</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Ordinary 4,000°C</span>
							</div>
							<div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">
								<span class="lang-zh">基准橙红光</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Orange Baseline</span>
							</div>
						</button>

						<button
							type="button"
							data-preset="wd1330"
							class="preset-btn px-2.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono font-bold border transition text-left cursor-pointer active:scale-95 bg-lime-950/80 border-lime-400 text-lime-300 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(132,204,22,0.3)]"
						>
							<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-lime-300">
								<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#8fee40] inline-block animate-pulse"></span>
								<span class="lang-zh">WD J1330+6435</span>
								<span class="lang-en">WD J1330+6435</span>
							</div>
							<div class="text-[10px] text-lime-400/80 mt-0.5">
								<span class="lang-zh">查特酒绿 · 钠致宽</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Chartreuse Green</span>
							</div>
						</button>

						<button
							type="button"
							data-preset="wd1011"
							class="preset-btn px-2.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono font-bold border transition text-left cursor-pointer active:scale-95 bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500"
						>
							<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-rose-300">
								<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#ff7b72] inline-block"></span>
								<span class="lang-zh">WD J1011+2845</span>
								<span class="lang-en">WD J1011+2845</span>
							</div>
							<div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">
								<span class="lang-zh">深肉粉 · 最红恒星</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Salmon Pink</span>
							</div>
						</button>

						<button
							type="button"
							data-preset="carbon"
							class="preset-btn px-2.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono font-bold border transition text-left cursor-pointer active:scale-95 bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500"
						>
							<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-fuchsia-300">
								<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#e879f9] inline-block"></span>
								<span class="lang-zh">富碳白矮星</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Carbon-Rich</span>
							</div>
							<div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">
								<span class="lang-zh">碳斯旺带 · 粉紫调</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Pink / Purple</span>
							</div>
						</button>

						<button
							type="button"
							data-preset="debris"
							class="preset-btn px-2.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono font-bold border transition text-left cursor-pointer active:scale-95 bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500"
						>
							<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-yellow-300">
								<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#facc15] inline-block"></span>
								<span class="lang-zh">岩质碎屑污染</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Debris-Polluted</span>
							</div>
							<div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">
								<span class="lang-zh">铁钙吸收 · 金黄色</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Yellow Tint</span>
							</div>
						</button>

						<button
							type="button"
							data-preset="h2he"
							class="preset-btn px-2.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono font-bold border transition text-left cursor-pointer active:scale-95 bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500"
						>
							<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-cyan-300">
								<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#22d3ee] inline-block"></span>
								<span class="lang-zh">冷氢氦碰撞星</span>
								<span class="lang-en">H+He Cool</span>
							</div>
							<div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">
								<span class="lang-zh">碰撞诱导吸收 · 青蓝</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Cyan / Pale Blue</span>
							</div>
						</button>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- MAIN TWO-COLUMN WORKBENCH: VISUALIZER & ABSORPTION SLIDERS -->
